# API and Services

- Prefer RTK Query endpoints for HTTP access; only use Axios directly for non-RTK integration points.
- Keep Axios usage centralized in shared clients/services with interceptors, base URL config, and typed responses.
- Normalize API errors into a consistent typed shape before surfacing to UI components.
- Never perform raw network calls in presentational components; call hooks/services instead.
- Keep service functions deterministic and side-effect-light so they are easy to test.
- Do not add alternate networking libraries or duplicate API clients without explicit project need.
